It bundles and adapts work from the following projects.
Each remains under its own license, and the upstream repository is named in
the `sources` field of the relevant `charts/<name>/Chart.yaml`.

- Helm charts under `charts/` for vLLM, Hugging Face text-generation-inference,
  text-embeddings-inference, Ollama, ChromaDB, the OPEA GenAIComps services
  and Kubeflow notebooks.
- Grafana dashboards under `charts/infracloud-dashboards/grafana-dashboards/`,
  forked from community dashboards for NVIDIA DCGM, vLLM, TGI and TEI, with
  local changes; the LiteLLM dashboard is written for this project.
- The model catalog under `backend/raw_data/models.yaml` describes models
  published by their own authors. The catalog is metadata; no model weights
  are distributed here.

Container images referenced by the charts and by the platform are pulled
from their own registries at deploy time and are not distributed with this
repository.
